Subject: [ReXGlue] merge s6/viewport

Class: RGO
What: One-entry GetHostViewportInfo cache.
Evidence: A/B -0.5 +-0.5 ms/frame (in combination only).
On / off: vulkan_viewport_info_cache (+_verify), off.
Commit: 1056402 (diff against 1056402^1)
Prepared by the WWE 2K14 recomp project (Session 15, prep only, not sent). Measured on one PC (Ryzen 9 5950X, RTX 4090), Vulkan backend, one title.

